### Prueba 1: Maria (Nueva mascota y dieta)
POST http://localhost:3000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11",
  "message": "Hey there! I just adopted a Golden Retriever named Max. Also, I have decided to become a strict vegetarian starting today."
}

